  "description": "Fairclinic Unscheduled Treatment: dental treatment that was accepted or proposed and never booked, per patient, with fees, insurance estimates and benefits left before the benefit year ends; old plans set aside for the dentist; a plain letter to one patient for one named person to send. Patient names are masked before results reach the model.",
